ab4cf", "message": "Create 1A.c\n\nProblem 1A\r\n\r\nTheatre Square in the capital city of Berland has a rectangular shape with the size n\u2009\u00d7\u2009m meters. On the occasion of the city's anniversary, a decision was taken to pave the Square with square granite flagstones. Each flagstone is of the size a\u2009\u00d7\u2009a.\r\n\r\nWhat is the least number of flagstones needed to pave the Square? It's allowed to cover the surface larger than the Theatre Square, but the Square has to be covered. It's not allowed to break the flagstones. The sides of flagstones should be parallel to the sides of the Square.\r\n\r\nInput\r\nThe input contains three positive integer numbers in the first line: n,\u2009\u2009m and a (1\u2009\u2264\u2009\u2009n,\u2009m,\u2009a\u2009\u2264\u2009109).\r\n\r\nOutput\r\nWrite the needed number of flagstones.\r\n\r\nSample test(s)\r\ninput\r\n6 6 4\r\noutput\r\n4", "created_at": "2013-09-20T05:26:07Z", "repo": "Codeforces", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f9701bb57dc01762dd8e30432fa4bb8e5926b53c", "message": "README.md commit", "created_at": "2013-09-16T16:36:41Z", "repo": "Codeforces", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "10bd619142565df4a4ca95b312e3c97b8a78ecb5", "message": "Update backup_ver3.py", "created_at": "2019-01-09T12:22:10Z", "repo": "BackUp_Script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "69a5567b815e871dfe4d105e6ddaafa312d8d2dc", "message": "Backup and README", "created_at": "2013-09-21T20:21:43Z", "repo": "BackUp_Script", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d61145a30cb7721b77904254323b7301b80a7718", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2013-09-28T04:57:58Z", "repo": "HangmanGamePython", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7a0a82153da926b6ada48d6ac1d249e2fffa47ee", "message": "Update hangman.py", "created_